The final budgeted level is \(n=283\). Its rank space is much larger, but the answer is still five vertices and the intended route is the same; this preserves the benchmark’s fixed-witness design rather than turning it into a transcription task.
diff --git a/gen_2212_02272.py b/gen_2212_02272.py
