The rejection quantifies the gap: the final mechanical scans require 5.6–7.3 billion tests, versus 219–222 compact operations. Nevertheless, both oracle vendors repeatedly executed the compact affine-cancellation/CRT route. The retained module compiles and preserves the working inverse generator and exact verifier for future re-audit.
